<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκελής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ</span>- euph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dried
				up, withered, worn out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκελέες καὶ ἄθυμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.463
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκελές</span> as Adv.,
				<i>toughly, stubbornly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. αἰεί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.68
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.543
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. αὔτως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					278
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκελέως</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰεί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.68
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> priv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλος</span>) <i>without legs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				34a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				717b17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> copul., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλος</span>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοσκελής</span>
			, <i>even,</i> of a balance, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				42
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
